<title>PORTUGAL: Vidago resumes trade, soars to record high.</title>
<headline>Vidago resumes trade, soars to record high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portuguese mineral water group Vidago Melgao e Pedras Salgadas SA resumed trade on Lisbon bourse sharply higher, up 650 escudos to a record high of 3,550, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares later eased back and stood at 3,100 escudos, up 200, at 1119 GMT.</p>
</text>
